<title>NETHERLANDS: HBG WINS 360 MLN U.S. ROAD CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>HBG WINS 360 MLN U.S. ROAD CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>RIJSWIJK, Netherlands 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction firm Hollandsche Beton Groep NV said on Friday it had won orders for a U.S. highway interchange construction project worth 360 million guilders ($180 million).</p>
</text>
